1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,600
I have everything I want in life, so there's nothing to spend it on.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,500
I mean, I could have 10 houses instead of one.

3
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:05,300
Would I be happier?

4
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:06,000
No way.

5
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:08,700
I could have 10 cars instead of two in the house.

6
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:10,300
I wouldn't be happier.

7
00:00:10,800 --> 00:00:11,600
It would drive me crazy.

8
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:19,400
I could have a 400-foot boat, and then I'd have a crew of 50 or 60, and some of them would be stealing from me, and some of them would be sleeping together.

9
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:21,200
I mean, who knows what would be going on?

10
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:26,800
So I don't, if I want to be a ship's captain, you know, I've gone into different professions.

11
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:28,600
I have everything in life I want.
